{
  "id": "showcase_notices_v1",
  "description": "Synthetic golden batch for the agentium-showcase-notices collection (NorthForge, all fictional). Demonstrates the UNIVERSAL chat orchestration baseline: the domain-neutral answer profiles precise_fact / summary / comparison plus a diversity case. NO project concept here - no project codes, no transversal/project inventory facet, no inventory route guard, no cross-project matching. Identifiers (PMP-700, BRG-22, SNS-09, VORTEX-5, FLT-3, GSK-8, LUB-40) are catalog references for products and spare parts, never projects. expected_sources are substrings of the seeded markdown filenames (see scripts.seed_showcase_workspace NOTICES_DOCS); evidence terms are exact identifiers and setpoints from those notices. The default golden batch is unchanged - this batch is loaded explicitly by tests and the offline runner. answer_profile here is the harness hint forwarded to the live request - it is one of the neutral profiles and never the inventory profile, so it arms nothing in the inventory facet.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "sc_001_pmp700_relief_valve_setpoint",
      "query": "At what pressure does the PMP-700 relief valve open?",
      "collection": "agentium-showcase-notices",
